/* ---- debug traces (hle_traces.c flags): 2 = the rectangle a1 points to (first 48 calls), 4 = the entity a0 points
   to, 8 = 64-bit a0/a1 in + v0/f0 out (calls 1-8, every 256th), 16 = the loading-screen state block. Used to find
   translation liveness bugs, e.g.
   TRACE(00231960, entity_add_rect_231960, 2)   TRACE(00593a40, loading_screen_time_593a40, 8) */

